# What is UI development?

Normal development: program as one-shot command, user manage input and output

UI development: program as persistent process

## Open problem: how to detect changes

Setter, getters
- Object-oriented programming
- Immediate-mode graphics programming

Events / signals
- Event-driven programming

Graph of chain reactions
- (Functional) Reactive programming

