# React-style reactive programming

## ecosystem

- React
- ReasonML
- Jetpack Compose?
- Vue?

## what

The art of graph construction

## what

- useState (ref): source of changes
- useEffect (watch): when detect change, run a procedure
- useMemo (compute): a variable: when detect change, run a function
- (useCallback: convenient wrapper over useMemo)
- return: sink of changes

## ..other 

- useRef: a variable outside of the system's control
- useLayoutEffect: like useEffect but guaranteed before UI layout processing
- useReducer: Elm

